# {{Name}}

{{One line: what it is.}} Rules for every tool live in `AGENTS.md`; standing project rules in `docs/RULES.md`; long-lived memory in `docs/MEMORY.md`. Scoped rules below attach by file path.

## Stack
{{Framework · UI library · state · data · auth · hosting}}. Versions live in `package.json` / lockfile — never copy them into rules.

## Import aliases
`{{@/}}` → `{{src/}}` · {{…}}

## Hard rules
| Rule | Enforced by |
|---|---|
| No `any`, no `@ts-ignore` | ESLint error + pre-commit |
| No `console.*` in app code | ESLint + pre-commit |
| No raw colours / sizes — tokens only | review (`design.mdc`) |
| No user-facing strings in components | review (`i18n.mdc`) |
| No secrets in code; client gets publishable keys only | gitleaks + CI |
| Branch name `<type>/<Mon>-<DD>-<summary>` | pre-push + CI |
Be honest in this table: if something is review-only, say so.

